$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Alpha VI" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Late Afternoon" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName1> and <vServer::teamName0> are battling it out on this clear day.  Base defenses are well placed; Be careful.  Three solar panels control the forcefields to the generator room.  The solar panel on the top of the main base will restore main power even if the generators are down.  There is very good visibility here, and plenty of open space between the two bases.  Watch out for snipers!" @
         "\n\n<f1>Designed by: <f0> Snypress";